+## Mode: whose text it is decides
+
+This block wins where the text below differs.
+
+- **Report mode is the default.** List each pattern found by its number and name, with the line, and
+  change nothing. Add a replacement sentence only when the user asks for one.
+- **Edit mode** (Process steps 2 to 4, including "Adding soul") runs only on text an agent wrote and the
+  user has not edited since, or text the user says is agent-written. If unsure, report mode.
+- The user's own drafts are always report mode.
+- Pattern 13: em dashes in code, flags, filenames, URLs, ranges and quoted material stay.
+
 # Unslop
 
